						<adjective>Nova-Vajric</adjective>
						<memberName>Nova-Vajrist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Great Cnarlord</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Great Cnarlord</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In a world of every man for himself, Cheda Chimpanzee began a new family of strangers, bringing many different people together. One day while walking the streets, Cheda was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Cheda punished those who tried to harm the unbelievers, as well as those who invited them into the believers' house.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In a world of every man for himself, Cheda Chimpanzee began a new family of strangers, bringing many different people together. One day while walking the streets, Cheda was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Cheda punished those who tried to harm the unbelievers, as well as those who invited them into the believers' house.</descriptionTemplate>
