					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Creticon</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Al-Khaliq</name>
									<type>Creator of Everything</type>
									<gender>Male</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Raider</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Psychic Path</name>
						<adjective>Raid-Mustalic</adjective>
						<memberName>Raid-Mustali</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Grand Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Grand Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In an old universe of strife, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Al-Khaliq&lt;/color&gt; whipped up great fire that swept away the last age, and brought forth a new one. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Al-Khaliq&lt;/color&gt; looked around him and saw the weak, sullen, and despised, and he in turn slew them each in blazing glory. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Al-Khaliq&lt;/color&gt; said to all the Raid-Mustalis, "Your mind is your greatest boon. Learn to use it, and no enemies will stand against you."</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In an old universe of strife, %%deity0_name%% whipped up great fire that swept away the last age, and brought forth a new one. %%Deity0_name%% looked around %%deity0_objective%% and saw the weak, sullen, and despised, and %%deity0_pronoun%% in turn slew them each in blazing glory. %%Deity0_name%% said to all the %%memberNamePlural%%, "Your mind is your greatest boon. Learn to use it, and no enemies will stand against you."</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>BS_MedievalCulture</culture>
						<iconDef>sw_SithDarkBrotherhood</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkSapphire</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.200, 0.403, 0.397, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_OriginIslamic</li>
							<li>Raider</li>
							<li>VME_PsychicFocus</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
