						<solid>True</solid>
						<id>26</id>
						<development IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Zoutera</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>the Balance</name>
						<adjective>riverine</adjective>
						<memberName>Streamwalker</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>High Warden</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>High Warden</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Water is not a weapon and we will not let it be made into one. We sell to the farmer, and we sell to the fleet that burned the farmer, and both hate us exactly as much — that is how we know the Balance is holding. Choose a side and the whole world dies of thirst. Inside our walls no one raises a hand. Outside our walls, we do not go.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"My family, my clan, my team - they all tried to keep a shroud over my eyes to stop me from seeing a simple fact: The true measure and power of a man lies in profit. Through water, we cleanse our bodies, minds, and souls, finding balance and enlightenment."

  - Raisa Mullen, Address on the prairie</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Jawa_Culture_Deepwater</culture>
						<iconDef>sw_Sienar</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightTeal</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.182, 0.504, 0.540, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Ideological</li>
							<li>Individualist</li>
							<li>AM_WaterPrimacy</li>
							<li>VME_Trader</li>
							<li>VME_Pacifist</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>raiding</name>
								<def>VME_Raiding_Abhorrent</def>
