						<solid>True</solid>
						<id>28</id>
						<development IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Boccocarro</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Meckgin</name>
						<adjective>just</adjective>
						<memberName>Justicar</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Archduke</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Archduke</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Meckgin is the shape a thing takes when it is made correctly. The hive is made correctly. The line is made correctly. A drone is not a life that was given a purpose; it is a purpose that was given a body, and when the body fails the purpose is poured into the next one. We do not mourn the mould. We test what came out of it, in the sand, where everyone can see.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"A single vital lesson was ingrained in all of us: The sunny outdoors is not a place of human flourishing, but a place of human death. Insectoids are adaptive, strong and resilient. They are simply superior to us humans in all respects."

  - Yuan 'Rabbit' Bakker, from the keynote to The Depth Meeting</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Jawa_Culture_Geonosian</culture>
						<iconDef>SpiralsE</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkGreen</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.613, 0.328, 0.167, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Ideological</li>
							<li>Collectivist</li>
							<li>Tunneler</li>
