						<id>22</id>
						<development IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Creticon</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>the Withdrawn</name>
									<type>That Which Was Given</type>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>the Covenant of Free Wells</name>
						<adjective>aquatic</adjective>
						<memberName>Waterkeeper</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>High Marshal</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>High Marshal</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Water was given once and the Giver stepped back, and we have not been spoken to since. That is not abandonment. It is the test. A well belongs to whoever is thirsty standing at it — we have never turned a stranger away, and we have buried our own for it. We do not take up arms and go out. We stand on our own ground, we keep the vaporators turning, and we answer to the silence.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% raped and murdered and stole, and a great guilt was upon %%deity0_objective%%, and in %%deity0_possessive%% selfishness %%deity0_pronoun%% cast this guilt upon %%deity0_possessive%% chosen people, and all were filthy with it. Speaking to the believers, %%deity0_name%% said: "Through the purity of water, you shall find renewal and the strength to carry forth my will." %%Deity0_name%% created all the noble animals and beasts of the land, and said, "Take these noble beasts, and through them make yourselves fruitful in my honor."</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Jawa_Culture_Homestead</culture>
						<iconDef>StarsD</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkPink</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.432, 0.382, 0.845, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_TheistAbstract</li>
							<li>Guilty</li>
							<li>Individualist</li>
							<li>Rancher</li>
							<li>AM_WaterPrimacy</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>charity</name>
								<def>Charity_Essential</def>
								<ID>42</ID>
								<randomSeed>138053063</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li>
								<name>ranching</name>
								<def>Ranching_Central</def>
								<ID>43</ID>
								<randomSeed>2059447691</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
