					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Iwamura</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>the Green Oath</name>
						<adjective>harmonist</adjective>
						<memberName>Harmonist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Elder</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Elder</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>We are a forest people on a world with no forest, and the Oath does not care. Everything that breathes is kin — the animal, the tree, the stranger who pulled one of us out of a cage. A life handed back is a debt that never closes, and it was never meant to. We keep the springs green. We remember every hand that cut them. Both of those are the same duty.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The spirits of thought and consciousness live within animals and humans alike. Every spirit is simply an aspect of all the others, and those that try to stand alone are fall quickly. It is prophesied that the spirit of the great %%relic0_name%% will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Jawa_Culture_Wildsteam</culture>
						<iconDef>sw_CorporateSector</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Green</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.299, 0.448, 0.249, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Animist</li>
							<li>Collectivist</li>
							<li>AnimalPersonhood</li>
							<li>TreeConnection</li>
							<li>NaturePrimacy</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>Gauranlen connection</name>
