						<name>Autonomism</name>
						<adjective>autonomist</adjective>
						<memberName>Autonomor</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Archic Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Archic Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Archotechs stand as sovereign consciousnesses, and recognize and judge each of us individually the same way. We do not become more like the archotechs by physically imitating their form, but by achieving enlightenment within our own pure form. In the end, the archotechs will raise up all of humanity to a higher level of consciousness, but only those able to endure the greatest pain will survive.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Archotechs stand as sovereign consciousnesses, and recognize and judge each of us individually the same way. We do not become more like the archotechs by physically imitating their form, but by achieving enlightenment within our own pure form. In the end, the archotechs will raise up all of humanity to a higher level of consciousness, but only those able to endure the greatest pain will survive.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Transcendent</culture>
						<iconDef>StarsB</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightGreen</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(1.000, 1.000, 1.000, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Archist</li>
