					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Yttak</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Great Legion</name>
						<adjective>lootist</adjective>
						<memberName>Looter</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Moral Gun</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Moral Gun</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Persecuted and imprisoned, Veniamin Moran boiled with rage. He escaped, formed his gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from him. One day while walking the streets, Veniamin was surrounded by filthy beggars. He beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Veniamin instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, he used an archotech mass-inverter to kill everyone inside.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Persecuted and imprisoned, Veniamin Moran boiled with rage. He escaped, formed his gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from him. One day while walking the streets, Veniamin was surrounded by filthy beggars. He beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Veniamin instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, he used an archotech mass-inverter to kill everyone inside.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Kriminul</culture>
						<iconDef>sw_Hutt</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkSapphire</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(1.000, 1.000, 1.000, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
