						<id>39</id>
						<development IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>DV_Uliger</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>the Weight</name>
						<adjective>cannibal</adjective>
						<memberName>Cannibal</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Scraplord</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Scraplord</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>We have no word for what we believe, because belief is not worn and everything real is worn. Weight is rank. What is bolted to you was cut off somebody slower, and the one who cuts it off you will be told what we were told: it was never yours, you were only carrying it a while. Nothing is wasted in the warrens. Not the plate. Not the meat.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"The whole planet was poor in resources, so we had to adapt, and use whatever scraps of ancient technology were lying around. Strife taught us one thing: You only have the right to what you can defend. Perhaps ancient technology is junk, or perhaps it is the key to our survival."</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Jawa_Culture_Junkers</culture>
						<iconDef>sw_SmugglersAlliance</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkOrange</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.535, 0.097, 0.097, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>AM_Structure_Scavenger</li>
							<li>Cannibal</li>
							<li>Raider</li>
							<li>VME_Scrapper</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>cannibalism</name>
								<def>Cannibalism_RequiredRavenous</def>
								<ID>4554</ID>
								<randomSeed>-696232724</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li>
								<name>raiding</name>
								<def>Raiding_Required</def>
								<ID>4555</ID>
								<randomSeed>-996539938</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li>
								<name>junk</name>
								<def>VME_Junk_Beautiful</def>
								<ID>4556</ID>
								<randomSeed>-1402774957</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Party of Scrap</name>
								<def>Adoption</def>
								<ID>4557</ID>
								<randomSeed>2116485594</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<descOverride>A speaker speaks for a while, then the adoptee lies on the altar and is officially adopted by the parent</descOverride>
								<nameMaker>NamerRitualFestival</nameMaker>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
