						<id>19</id>
						<development IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Boccocarro</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>the Contract</name>
						<adjective>libertine</adjective>
						<memberName>Libertor</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Captain</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Captain</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>A contract is the only honest thing two strangers can hold between them. It names one person, one price, one ending, and everyone not written into it walks away untouched. We do not pillage — pillage is confessing you could not find the one you came for. Take the mark or refuse it in the open. Once it is taken it is finished, or you are.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"It is thus that we learn one single truth: "You must live being true to the single purpose of the present moment". The most important thing I've learned is that the reason we suffer so much is because we deserve it for what we've done. Wanting to be unknown, unpossessed by others' knowledge of you. That is freedom."

  - Sofia Bukhalova, from the keynote to The Freedom Discussion</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Jawa_Culture_Blackstar</culture>
						<iconDef>sw_MonCalamari</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightRed</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.512, 0.092, 0.092, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Ideological</li>
							<li>Guilty</li>
							<li>Individualist</li>
							<li>VME_Bushido</li>
							<li>VME_Anonymity</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>charity</name>
								<def>Charity_Essential</def>
								<ID>311</ID>
								<randomSeed>-2126798967</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li>
								<name>anonymity</name>
								<def>VME_Anonymity_Required</def>
								<ID>312</ID>
								<randomSeed>-1671370003</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li>
								<name>defeat</name>
								<def>VME_Defeat_Dishonorable</def>
								<ID>313</ID>
								<randomSeed>1375819521</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li>
								<name>social interactions</name>
								<def>VME_SocialInteractions_Disallowed</def>
								<ID>314</ID>
								<randomSeed>-1024384251</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Shameful Fiesta</name>
								<def>Adoption</def>
								<ID>315</ID>
								<randomSeed>2091158199</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<descOverride>A speaker speaks for a while, then the adoptee lies on the altar and is officially adopted by the parent</descOverride>
								<nameMaker>NamerRitualFestival</nameMaker>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<shortDescOverride>adoption ritual</shortDescOverride>
