					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Nuchadus</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Supreme Leader</name>
									<type>Pontifex of Eternity</type>
									<gender>Female</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>VME_HolyDiseases</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Diseased Simplicity</name>
						<adjective>totalitarian</adjective>
						<memberName>Subject</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Great Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Great Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Banzo Megascarab was a theologist in one of the Glitterworlds. She posited that a life of gluttony and vices is meaningless, and that only by living an austere, monastic life can one reach true enlightenment. Megascarab punished those who tried to harm the unbelievers, as well as those who invited them into the believers' house. Megascarab assembled a team of great geneticists to modify the human body, making it more resistant to diseases by gradually inflicting healthy bodies with them.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Banzo Megascarab was a theologist in one of the Glitterworlds. She posited that a life of gluttony and vices is meaningless, and that only by living an austere, monastic life can one reach true enlightenment. Megascarab punished those who tried to harm the unbelievers, as well as those who invited them into the believers' house. Megascarab assembled a team of great geneticists to modify the human body, making it more resistant to diseases by gradually inflicting healthy bodies with them.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>sw_JediGuard</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Mauve</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.268, 0.723, 0.341, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>VME_Structure_CultOfPersonality</li>
							<li>Loyalist</li>
							<li>AM_Monastic</li>
							<li>VME_HolyDiseases</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>drug use</name>
								<def>DrugUse_Prohibited</def>
								<ID>561</ID>
								<randomSeed>-1935306601</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Unified Jubilee</name>
								<def>Adoption</def>
								<ID>562</ID>
								<randomSeed>963166770</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<descOverride>A speaker speaks for a while, then the adoptee lies on the altar and is officially adopted by the parent</descOverride>
								<nameMaker>NamerRitualFestival</nameMaker>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<shortDescOverride>adoption ritual</shortDescOverride>
								<iconPathOverride>UI/Icons/Rituals/Adoption</iconPathOverride>
								<patternGroupTag>Adopt</patternGroupTag>
								<isAnytime>True</isAnytime>
								<canBeAnytime>True</canBeAnytime>
								<playsIdeoMusic>True</playsIdeoMusic>
								<generatedAttachedReward>True</generatedAttachedReward>
								<sourcePattern>Adoption</sourcePattern>
								<obligationTargetFilter Class="RitualObligationTargetWorker_AnyGatherSpotOrAltar">
									<def>GatheringSpotOrAltar</def>
									<parent>Precept_562</parent>
								</obligationTargetFilter>
								<targetFilter IsNull="True" />
								<behavior>
									<def>Adopt</def>
								</behavior>
								<triggers>
									<li Class="RitualObligationTrigger_Date">
										<mustBePlayerIdeo>True</mustBePlayerIdeo>
										<triggerDaysSinceStartOfYear>3</triggerDaysSinceStartOfYear>
									</li>
								</triggers>
								<outcomeEffect Class="TPRitualAttachableOutcomes.RitualOutcomeEffectWorker_FromQuality_TP_Custom">
									<def>AdoptionOutcome</def>
									<compDatas>
										<li IsNull="True" />
										<li IsNull="True" />
										<li Class="RitualOutcomeComp_DataThingPresence">
											<presentForTicks>
												<keys />
												<values />
											</presentForTicks>
										</li>
										<li IsNull="True" />
									</compDatas>
								</outcomeEffect>
								<layerWhitelist IsNull="True" />
								<layerBlacklist IsNull="True" />
								<activeObligations IsNull="True" />
								<completedObligations IsNull="True" />
								<lastFinishedTick>-1</lastFinishedTick>
							</li>
