						<leaderTitleMale>Indescribable Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Indescribable Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Gods are not the ultimate predator in the Universe, for there are ancient entities far more powerful. Entities that should be respected... And feared. They do not care about humanity. We are nothing to them. Not even a footnote. The eldritch entities are old and evil beyond all imagining. We will destroy all images of them, for portraying their physical form is infinitely obscene.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Gods are not the ultimate predator in the Universe, for there are ancient entities far more powerful. Entities that should be respected... And feared. They do not care about humanity. We are nothing to them. Not even a footnote. The eldritch entities are old and evil beyond all imagining. We will destroy all images of them, for portraying their physical form is infinitely obscene.</descriptionTemplate>
