					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Rogia</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Tzevaot</name>
									<type>Universal God</type>
									<gender>Male</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Supremacist</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Path of Dominance</name>
						<adjective>dominant</adjective>
						<memberName>Dominator</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Wise Rebbe</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Wise Rebbe</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"God is not a human, that he should lie, not a human being, that he should change his mind. Does he speak and then not act? Does he promise and not fulfill? You will realize that we've long since proven that we have the strength to rightfully rule this universe. No one can argue with that. The salvation of God is like the blink of an eye."

  - Su - ran Kim's revision of the Ketuvim, 25th Edition</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"God is not a human, that he should lie, not a human being, that he should change his mind. Does he speak and then not act? Does he promise and not fulfill? You will realize that we've long since proven that we have the strength to rightfully rule this universe. No one can argue with that. The salvation of God is like the blink of an eye."

  - Su - ran Kim's revision of the Ketuvim, 25th Edition</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>FistRaised</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkPurple</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.423, 0.664, 0.980, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>AM_Structure_Jewish</li>
							<li>Supremacist</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Great Party</name>
								<def>Adoption</def>
								<ID>1361</ID>
								<randomSeed>-1804335579</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<descOverride>A speaker speaks for a while, then the adoptee lies on the altar and is officially adopted by the parent</descOverride>
								<nameMaker>NamerRitualFestival</nameMaker>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<shortDescOverride>adoption ritual</shortDescOverride>
								<iconPathOverride>UI/Icons/Rituals/Adoption</iconPathOverride>
								<patternGroupTag>Adopt</patternGroupTag>
								<canBeAnytime>True</canBeAnytime>
								<playsIdeoMusic>True</playsIdeoMusic>
								<generatedAttachedReward>True</generatedAttachedReward>
								<sourcePattern>Adoption</sourcePattern>
								<obligationTargetFilter Class="RitualObligationTargetWorker_AnyGatherSpotOrAltar">
									<def>GatheringSpotOrAltar</def>
									<parent>Precept_1361</parent>
								</obligationTargetFilter>
								<targetFilter IsNull="True" />
								<behavior>
									<def>Adopt</def>
								</behavior>
								<triggers>
									<li Class="RitualObligationTrigger_Date">
										<mustBePlayerIdeo>True</mustBePlayerIdeo>
										<triggerDaysSinceStartOfYear>51</triggerDaysSinceStartOfYear>
									</li>
								</triggers>
								<outcomeEffect Class="TPRitualAttachableOutcomes.RitualOutcomeEffectWorker_FromQuality_TP_Custom">
									<def>AdoptionOutcome</def>
									<compDatas>
										<li IsNull="True" />
										<li IsNull="True" />
										<li Class="RitualOutcomeComp_DataThingPresence">
											<presentForTicks>
												<keys />
												<values />
											</presentForTicks>
										</li>
										<li IsNull="True" />
									</compDatas>
								</outcomeEffect>
								<layerWhitelist IsNull="True" />
								<layerBlacklist IsNull="True" />
								<activeObligations IsNull="True" />
								<completedObligations IsNull="True" />
								<lastFinishedTick>-1</lastFinishedTick>
