					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Bagua5</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Kahlom</name>
									<type>Bringer of War</type>
									<gender>Male</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityEvil</iconPath>
								</li>
								<li>
									<name>Mivlak</name>
									<type>Bringer of Peace</type>
									<gender>Female</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGood</iconPath>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Truth of Power</name>
						<adjective>freedomist</adjective>
						<memberName>Freeist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Khan</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Khan</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Kahlom: Bringer of war, our god forged of tempered steel, brought us to battle and lead us to the conquest of Princeps. But, once accomplished our creators sought to destroy us, to reap our harvest. And so we ran, and Mivlak was born of the peace that came from our escape. The gods now dance in a beautiful waltz throughout, and our shamans communicate with them, for advice, and blessings. We raid, and destroy others to claim our homes. Without a claim, we are nothing.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Kristy 'Shorty' Wade was a renowned martial artist in one of the Glitterworlds. She posited that only a life lived with honour, courage and skill is worth living. By setting one's heart right every morning and evening, he gains freedom in the Way. His whole life will be without blame, and he will succeed in his calling. Shorty broke every social rule the oppressors tried to enforce, just to show that she could. Anonymity is a shield from the tyranny of the majority.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>DV_Uligerva</culture>
						<iconDef>sw_Pantoran</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkMauve</colorDef>
