					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Wavia</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Christ</name>
									<type>All-Powerful God</type>
									<gender>Female</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Supremacist</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>The Army</name>
						<adjective>Cow-Catholic</adjective>
						<memberName>Cow-Catholic</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>First Ecclesiast</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>First Ecclesiast</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The people of the oceanic planet Wavia worshipped &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Christ&lt;/color&gt;. She saw that they were suited for dominance, and ordained that these worshippers would rule above all others. An evil whaler admiral and his whaler-marines enslaved the worshippers of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Christ&lt;/color&gt;. A hero named Sou 'Panshen' Hakusyun tried to assassinate the whaler admiral. She failed, but &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Christ&lt;/color&gt; witnessed Panshen's struggle, and anointed her as the prophet of the Cow-Catholics. Panshen ambushed the whaler admiral at the capitol bridge, claiming his cattle and driving their enemies out of the frontier.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The people of the oceanic planet Wavia worshipped %%deity0_name%%. %%Deity0_pronoun%% saw that they were suited for dominance, and ordained that these worshippers would rule above all others. An evil whaler admiral and his whaler-marines enslaved the worshippers of %%deity0_name%%. A hero named Sou 'Panshen' Hakusyun tried to assassinate the whaler admiral. She failed, but %%deity0_name%% witnessed Panshen's struggle, and anointed her as the prophet of the %%memberNamePlural%%. Panshen ambushed the whaler admiral at the capitol bridge, claiming his cattle and driving their enemies out of the frontier.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
