						<leaderTitleMale>Cyber Dog</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Cyber Dog</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Persecuted and imprisoned, Adrián The Charming boiled with rage. He escaped, formed his gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from him. Adrián assembled a team of great scientists and inventors to re-define humanity. Adrián instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, he used cluster bombs to kill everyone inside.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Persecuted and imprisoned, Adrián The Charming boiled with rage. He escaped, formed his gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from him. Adrián assembled a team of great scientists and inventors to re-define humanity. Adrián instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, he used cluster bombs to kill everyone inside.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>VFEP_Khanate</culture>
