					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Nuchadus</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Kleptism</name>
						<adjective>kleptic</adjective>
						<memberName>Kleptor</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Moral Thug</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Moral Thug</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"The prey people can teach you things even as they die under your knife. One old lady taught me that humanity's heavenly future is not a thing of meat and bone, but of silicon and exochrome. That's why we're proud to express the strength of our hearts using the heels of our boots."

  - Isobel 'Izzles' McAdie, Speech in the smalltown</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"The prey people can teach you things even as they die under your knife. One old lady taught me that humanity's heavenly future is not a thing of meat and bone, but of silicon and exochrome. That's why we're proud to express the strength of our hearts using the heels of our boots."

  - Isobel 'Izzles' McAdie, Speech in the smalltown</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Kriminul</culture>
