						</foundation>
						<name>Cult of Power</name>
						<adjective>powerist</adjective>
						<memberName>Poweror</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Big Thug</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Big Thug</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"The first ten among my followers tore the devices from their skin with bare hands, and in the blood spatters on the grimy floor I suddenly perceived the truth we had all been missing: We've long since proven that we have the strength to rightfully rule this universe. If anyone disagrees, I'm always ready to defend myself."

  - Nina 'Bubbles' Gabor</description>
