					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Iwamura</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Human Academy</name>
						<adjective>archist</adjective>
						<memberName>Archist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Scraplord</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Scraplord</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Humanity's pursuit of technology gave birth to the all-powerful archotechs as the rightful next step in the development of consciousness. Archotechs touch every human consciousness directly on a regular basis, imparting wisdom only to those that seek the knowledge of the archotechs. In the future, by observing humanity, the archotechs will finally understand their purpose, and lift confident humanity up to rule them.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Humanity's pursuit of technology gave birth to the all-powerful archotechs as the rightful next step in the development of consciousness. Archotechs touch every human consciousness directly on a regular basis, imparting wisdom only to those that seek the knowledge of the archotechs. In the future, by observing humanity, the archotechs will finally understand their purpose, and lift confident humanity up to rule them.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Jawa_Culture_Junkers</culture>
						<iconDef>SpiralsB</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Sapphire</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(1.000, 1.000, 1.000, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Archist</li>
							<li>Loyalist</li>
							<li>Transhumanist</li>
							<li>HumanPrimacy</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Archic Festival</name>
								<def>Adoption</def>
								<ID>5999</ID>
								<randomSeed>-134538830</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<descOverride>A speaker speaks for a while, then the adoptee lies on the altar and is officially adopted by the parent</descOverride>
								<nameMaker>NamerRitualFestival</nameMaker>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<shortDescOverride>adoption ritual</shortDescOverride>
								<iconPathOverride>UI/Icons/Rituals/Adoption</iconPathOverride>
								<patternGroupTag>Adopt</patternGroupTag>
								<isAnytime>True</isAnytime>
								<canBeAnytime>True</canBeAnytime>
								<playsIdeoMusic>True</playsIdeoMusic>
								<generatedAttachedReward>True</generatedAttachedReward>
								<sourcePattern>Adoption</sourcePattern>
								<obligationTargetFilter Class="RitualObligationTargetWorker_AnyGatherSpotOrAltar">
									<def>GatheringSpotOrAltar</def>
									<parent>Precept_5999</parent>
