						<adjective>Neo-Mahic</adjective>
						<memberName>Neo-Mahist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Enlightened Boss</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Enlightened Boss</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Chelsea 'Chelse' Zimmerman was a great scholar, and she studied for decades the intricate symbiotic relationship between the Gauranlen trees and their dryads, as well as the intriguing psychic link they share with humanity. Chelse left her backwards homeworld and spread novel techniques of armour forging along all the Rim. Some of the false believers tried to break the rules and decide their own paths. Chelse punished them severely.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Chelsea 'Chelse' Zimmerman was a great scholar, and she studied for decades the intricate symbiotic relationship between the Gauranlen trees and their dryads, as well as the intriguing psychic link they share with humanity. Chelse left her backwards homeworld and spread novel techniques of armour forging along all the Rim. Some of the false believers tried to break the rules and decide their own paths. Chelse punished them severely.</descriptionTemplate>
