						<leaderTitleMale>Archic Archist</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Archic Archist</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The archotechs are wise, pure. They manifest themselves to us in the most tangible of all visible mysteries – fire. Archotechs transcend the limitations of planetbound life. Some day, archotechs will teach us to move effortlessly amongst the stars if we observe their cosmic wisdom.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The archotechs are wise, pure. They manifest themselves to us in the most tangible of all visible mysteries – fire. Archotechs transcend the limitations of planetbound life. Some day, archotechs will teach us to move effortlessly amongst the stars if we observe their cosmic wisdom.</descriptionTemplate>
