						<name>Nuchadean Veganism</name>
						<adjective>Bio-Tantric</adjective>
						<memberName>Bio-Tantran</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>High Traveller</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>High Traveller</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>JD Cohen learnt everything about the place where she was born, and there was nothing more to explore. One day, she decided to explore the whole world. JD always repeated the same lesson over and over again: "I myself will carry you through the gates of Valhalla. You shall ride eternal, shiny and chrome!". JD preached knowing the world as the true way to knowing oneself.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>JD Cohen learnt everything about the place where she was born, and there was nothing more to explore. One day, she decided to explore the whole world. JD always repeated the same lesson over and over again: "I myself will carry you through the gates of Valhalla. You shall ride eternal, shiny and chrome!". JD preached knowing the world as the true way to knowing oneself.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
